aws for that offset/candidate.","worst_anchor_pair_upper":{"x":19,"r":2.847970374410148,"early_fail_count":355,"late_fail_count":350,"early_cp_upper":0.0779317494011822,"late_cp_upper":0.07698869505757798,"pair_upper_min":0.07698869505757798}},"continuum_transport":{"event":"both adjacent candidates fail their own weighted crossing thresholds","anchor_pair_upper":"u=min(U_early,U_late), since P(F_early and F_late)<=min(P(F_early),P(F_late))","path_kl":"For fixed integer offset x, only Q observations vary with r. The joint path through the late candidate contains N_Q=H+g-x=128-x Q observations, so D(path_r||path_a)=(128-x) D_KL(Q_r||Q_a).","gaussian_kl":"D_KL(Q_r||Q_a)=0.5[log(a/r)+(r+(mu(r)-mu(a))^2)/a-1].","binary_transport":"By data processing through the failure indicator, kl(p_r||p_a)<=D(path_r||path_a). If p_a<=u<p_r, then kl(p_r||u)<=D(path_r||path_a). Each anchor interval is therefore defined by (128-x)D_KL(Q_r||Q_a)<=kl(0.09||u).","coverage_result":"The union of the 137 anchor intervals covers the entire r interval for every x in {0,...,32}; no uncovered gap remained in the double-precision root/merge calculation.","merge_tolerance_r":1e-12,"target_bound":"On the simultaneous Clopper-Pearson event, pair failure probability <=0.09 for every covered r and every discrete offset x. This leaves 0.01 absolute power-failure slack below beta=0.10."},"scope_and_caveats":["This certifies the exact Gaussian KL level D_KL(Q||P)=0.5, not all Q with D_KL>=0.5.","Discrete-time step changes induce integer changepoint offsets x=0,...,g. A real-valued between-sample changepoint is observationally equivalent to one of these integer partitions; within-sample mixture changes are outside scope.","The negative-mean branch is covered by sign symmetry of the Gaussian maximized-likelihood/SNML statistic under x->-x.","The probability statement is randomized over the offline Monte Carlo certificate, with simultaneous confidence at least the recorded union bound. The final interval roots/coverage merge use ordinary double precision, not machine-verified interval arithmetic.","No O, other worker, comparator/integrator/index/feed/audit, legacy/pre-independence, shared-ledger, or other-role receipt semantics were used."]}